# DroidWorks U.S.A.

## Droid #01 — Integrated Bringup r01

**Date:** October 2, 2026
**Status:** Operational baseline

---

## Overview

Droid #01 has reached its first fully integrated system baseline.

The individual hardware, sensor, processing, expression, and debug components that had previously been tested independently are now brought up through a single ROS 2 launch file:

```text
droid01_bringup_r01.launch.py
```

This launch configuration represents the current known-good configuration of Droid #01 and establishes **r01** as the first integrated bringup baseline.

The system can now be started with a single command rather than manually launching each component.

