## Complete Bringup

The complete system is now launched through:

```text
droid01_bringup_r01.launch.py
```

The launch sequence intentionally starts the system in stages:

```text
Hardware Manager
       ↓
Sensor Entry Nodes
       ↓
Fusion / Orientation
       ↓
Behavior
       ↓
OLED Expression
       ↓
CYD Debug Surface
```

The staged startup gives the Hardware Manager an opportunity to discover the physical devices before the hardware entry nodes attempt to establish their serial connections.

The system was successfully launched without the serial-port conflicts encountered during earlier development.

