## Verification

The integrated system was physically tested after launching through the new master bringup file.

The following behaviors were verified:

### Motion

Physical movement around the droid produced corresponding motion activity in the ROS system and on the CYD.

### Distance

Objects placed within the sensing range produced corresponding distance information on the CYD.

### Orientation

Moving and tilting the physical droid produced corresponding orientation changes on the CYD.

### Expression

The OLED changed its expression in response to the droid's behavioral state.

### Wireless Debugging

The CYD successfully received the droid's internal information through the existing MQTT path.

### Complete Startup

All six hardware devices were discovered by the Hardware Manager, assigned to their appropriate entry nodes, and brought into the ROS system through the single r01 launch configuration.

